config IIO_STM401
	tristate "Motorola STM401 sensor hub"
	depends on I2C
	depends on INPUT
	select IIO_BUFFER
	select IIO_KFIFO_BUF
	help
	  Say yes here to support the Motorola STM401 sensor hub found in
	  the Moto X 2014 (victara). The hub runs Motorola firmware on an
	  STM32 and reports the accelerometer, gyroscope, magnetometer,
	  ambient light, proximity, temperature, rotation vectors and step
	  counter as IIO devices, and the Moto gestures (chop chop, camera
	  twist, lift, flat, stowed, significant motion) as IIO events on
	  the stm401-gestures device and as keys on an input device.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module
	  will be called stm401.
